      "<li><strong>Install</strong> &mdash; delivered and assembled inside approved hours with hallway protection, then leveled, scribed, and punched out.</li>",
      "</ol>",
      "<p>Vanity or closet work in the same unit can share a freight week &mdash; sketch a vanity in <a href=\"https://greencabinetsny.com/designer\">the online designer</a> or see <a href=\"https://greencabinetsny.com/blog/reach-in-closet-millwork-manhattan-coops\">reach-in closet millwork for Manhattan co-ops</a>.</p>",
      "<h2>Pricing language without fake testimonials</h2>",
