      "<h2>Get a quote for your small NYC bathroom vanity</h2>",
      "<p>Spec a layout in the <a href=\"https://greencabinetsny.com/designer\">vanity designer</a>, then email <a href=\"mailto:orders@greencabinetsny.com\">orders@greencabinetsny.com</a> or call <a href=\"tel:+17188045488\">(718) 804-5488</a>. Green Cabinets NY &mdash; custom millwork by appointment in Brooklyn, Manhattan, and Queens.</p>",
